    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> 1 charge, regained at dawn. Magic action: toss the coin at one creature within 60 ft. The module rolls a die: <strong>Heads</strong> (even) - the target makes a DC 13 WIS save, taking 2d4 Psychic damage and Disadvantage on its next attack roll before the end of its next turn on a failure, or half damage only on a success. <strong>Tails</strong> (odd) - you take 1d4 Psychic damage.</p>",
